+# Project Atlas — Q3 status (internal)
+
+## Progress
+Migration of the billing module finished on 4 Sept, two weeks late because the vendor's connector needed a rewrite. Test coverage is at 71 % (target 80 %). Three of four regional teams are live.
+
+## The decision we need
+The current connector vendor has announced end-of-support for our version in March. Options: (a) upgrade with them, €140k, 6 weeks, their team; (b) switch to the in-house connector the platform team built for the EMEA rollout, €60k of our time, 9 weeks, and we depend on the platform team's roadmap. The steering committee asked for the division head's preference by 15 October because (a) needs a purchase order this quarter.
+
+## Risks
+- Platform team capacity in Q4 is uncertain (two hires pending).
+- The fourth regional team (APAC) has a data-residency question open with Legal.
+
